WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — agency (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.050
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, agbẹjọro gbọdọ ṣe igbiyanju lati de ibi-afẹde kan, ṣe iṣẹ lori agbaye, ati duro ninu owo-ori agbara.

2
00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:19.781
<v Narrator>Ninu gbogbo awọn ọran, o jẹ pataki lati ṣe akiyesi iyatọ laarin awọn ayipada ti o ni ipa lori agbara ati awọn ayipada ti ko ni ipa.

3
00:00:19.861 --> 00:00:27.890
<v Narrator>Keji, laarin awọn eto ti o pari iṣẹ naa ni deede, ọkan ti o dara julọ ni ẹniti o lo agbara kere si.
